---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import { ABOUT } from "@consts";
import Link from "@components/Link.astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<Layout title={ABOUT.TITLE} description={ABOUT.DESCRIPTION}>
  <Container>
    <aside data-pagefind-ignore>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div class="animate font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
          About myself
        </div>
        <section class="animate not-prose flex flex-col gap-4 text-justify">
          <p class="text-justify">Born in France, I am currently doing my PhD in Copenhagen. In other 
            <Link href="https://csebastiao.github.io/CV/">
                  work experiences
            </Link>
            I worked in several research labs in France (Marseille, Lyon, Grenoble, and Besançon) and abroad (Turin, Boston).
          </p>

          <p class="text-justify">My hobbies are mostly playing video games and reading books, both fiction and non-fiction. 
            I am always looking to expand the neverending list of recommendations for both, so feel free to suggest some!
          </p>

          <p class="text-justify">As an overly curious child, I spent my time reading books and observing insects. Ants, mostly. 
            Devouring any content related to insects my parents could find me, I quickly discovered a word I was proud as an 8-year-old 
            to make even adults learn about it: entomologist. You're telling me I can have as a job to learn more about insects ? Of course 
            I wanted to be one ! What better future than to keep on having fun as an adult ? I still have that childish wonder, but now I also believe
            that I can support societal changes through my work. I believe that as a researcher I am standing on the shoulder of giants.
            Not only scientific ones, as the saying frequently goes, but also those who gave me the privileges to do that job. And I will be
            forever grateful for this.
          </p>

        </section>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center">
          <div class="my-10 text-center">
            <div class="bg-neutral-300 w-[350px] h-[350px] object-cover rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={'/picture-me.jpg'}
                alt={'Picture of myself'}
                width={350}
                height={250}
                class="w-[350px] h-[350px] object-cover rounded-xl overflow-hidden"
              />
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Say hi whenever 👋</p>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </Container>
</Layout>
